  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></munderover><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Required power, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p>"
